**23 Jul 2026 v5**

*Accessibility note: This Word resource uses built-in heading styles for navigation, simple non-merged tables with repeated header rows, high-contrast table headings, descriptive table captions, and plain language labels.*

# **Purpose of this resource**

Version 5 adds INF-7 (data breach incident response process, surfaced by the new Privacy Policy breach-notification clause), and confirms account authentication is magic-link-only (no password/passphrase) — relevant to BUILD-9’s scope. It also updates the solicitor pack version references: covering letter, Privacy Policy, and Terms of Service are now all v2 (added data-breach, PECR/marketing, medical-device-boundary, and negligence-liability content); Product & Data Overview, Safeguarding one-pager, and IP/trademark question sheet remain v1; the Crisis & Safeguarding Policy remains v7. Version 4 additions (BIZ-9, BUILD-9, Supabase DPA sub-task) are retained unchanged. No other content changes from v4.

